title Ruins of Ahn'Qiraj
faction Horde
category Dungeons
folder Completionist dungeons and raids
levels 59-60
zone Silithus
pitch Ruins of Ahn'Qiraj, in Silithus. A raid.
why Every Horde quest of Ruins of Ahn'Qiraj: the chains that lead to it, the pick-ups before the run and the hand-ins after it.

step Getting there
  note The entrance is in Silithus: the arrow leads to it. This is a raid: it needs a raid group.

